  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your grace and agility in movement are uncanny.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Gliding Steps<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain the benefits of this feat even when your ki pool is empty. In addition, you can expend one use of your mythic power in place of one point from your ki pool to avoid provoking attacks of opportunity during your move.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
